+	/**
+	 * Creates a new Row and assigns the given values to the Row's fields.
+	 * This is more convenient than using the constructor.
+	 *
+	 * <p>For example:
+	 *
+	 * <pre>
+	 *     Row.of("hello", true, 1L);}
+	 * </pre>
+	 * instead of
+	 * <pre>
